      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CATCH CARTER (3) held third at this track when beaten just over a length by Champeze. His previous CL3 run on heavy ground at Northam was plain, but the return to good ground and the booking of a rider with a sound record on him give him a strong platform. AMARLIE MISS (8) has not been finishing close up, yet her latest CL2 run at Kalgoorlie was only just over four lengths from Wiluna Lass and she now gets weight relief, race fitness and a proven record at this venue. Expecting a much better effort third-up. CLEVER COMBAT (9) is a genuine danger after a solid second to Versaille at this track first-up, with the CL2 form, winning rider back and lower weight all in his favour. DIEGO DYNAMITE (10) is racing well without winning and continues to threaten. Today may be his day. FIRE THE GUARD (1) was so,id last start at Kalgoorlie and can't be discounted on that effort.",
